The original 1904 edition of *Poesias infantis* by Olavo Bilac
(text and illustrations) is in the public domain in Brazil
(author died 1918; patrimonial rights expired 1 January 1989)
and in other jurisdictions where the term has elapsed.

This repository's extraction, restoration, markup, scripts, and
editorial apparatus are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The Biblioteca Brasiliana Guita e José Mindlin scan
(https://digital.bbm.usp.br/handle/bbm/4694) is the source of the
page images. That digitization is marked "Domínio público" by BBM.
The scan is not the remastered edition.

A facsimile of the scan may appear in GitHub Releases. It remains
a digital photograph of one physical copy, including a handwritten
dedication that is not part of the published work.
